OL,5,G1700 War Factories
OL,6,     FBattle For Black Gold: The story
OL,7,     Fof the discovery and exploitation
OL,8,     Fof the Baku Oilfields in the
OL,9,     FRussian Caucasus, which forced
OL,10,     FStalin and Hitler to face-off in
OL,11,     Fthe battle of Stalingrad.
